<title>UK: SBC sets call and put warrants on Metro AG.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call and put warrants on Metro AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG says it has issued three million American-style call and put warrants, in three equal tranches, on Metro AG.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS   STRIKE	 ISS PRICE   PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A     130.00 DEM   14.79 DEM   11.80 PCT    8.80 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B     140.00 DEM   10.23 DEM   16.00 PCT   12.70 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT C	120.00 DEM    9.83 DEM   14.90 PCT   13.20 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.NOV.96-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	28.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  129.50 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     - </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
